11:T1067,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Are eye tests free at Duncan & Todd in Scotland?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, all residents of Scotland are entitled to a free NHS eye test, regardless of age, income, or medical history. This applies at all Duncan & Todd practices in Scotland. The Scottish Government has provided universal free eye tests since 2006 as part of its commitment to preventive healthcare. If you live in England and visit a Duncan & Todd practice south of the border, standard NHS eligibility criteria apply."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where does Duncan & Todd have practices?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Duncan & Todd operates approximately 30 practices across Scotland and the north of England. In Scotland, you will find practices in Edinburgh, Glasgow, Aberdeen, Dundee, Inverness, Stirling, and Perth. In England, the group has practices in Newcastle, Sunderland, Durham, Middlesbrough, Darlington, Carlisle, Leeds, and York. The group continues to expand, particularly in northern England."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Duncan & Todd an independent opticians?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Duncan & Todd is an independent optical group. It is not part of a multinational corporation like Boots (EssilorLuxottica) or Specsavers. The company was founded in Aberdeen in 1972 and has grown through a combination of organic expansion and acquisition of local practices. Its independent status allows it to choose its own range of frames, invest in the technology it considers most important, and maintain a distinctive approach to patient care."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What frame brands does Duncan & Todd stock?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Duncan & Todd carries a curated selection of premium, designer, and independent frame brands. The range typically includes names such as Tom Ford, Gucci, Saint Laurent, Lindberg, and Silhouette, alongside more widely available brands like Ray-Ban and Hugo Boss. Each practice may have a slightly different selection, and staff can help you find frames that suit your face shape, prescription, and budget."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Duncan & Todd offer hearing care?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Duncan & Todd provides hearing assessments and hearing aid services at selected practices. Hearing tests are free, and if hearing loss is identified, the audiologist will discuss a range of hearing aid options from leading manufacturers. Not all Duncan & Todd locations have audiology clinics, so check availability when booking."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book a Duncan & Todd appointment through eyetest.co.uk?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Duncan & Todd practices are available for booking through eyetest.co.uk. Enter your postcode to find your nearest practice, choose your appointment type, and select a date and time that suits you. You will receive a confirmation email with everything you need to know before your visit."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does the NHS optical voucher scheme work in Scotland?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"In Scotland, all residents receive free NHS eye tests, and NHS optical vouchers are available to help with the cost of glasses. The voucher values are set by NHS Scotland and depend on your prescription and personal circumstances. Children, people on qualifying benefits, and those with complex prescriptions receive higher-value vouchers. Your Duncan & Todd dispensing optician will explain exactly how much the voucher covers and what, if anything, you will need to pay on top."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Duncan & Todd offer contact lenses?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Duncan & Todd offers a full contact lens service including initial assessments, trial fittings, and ongoing supply. They stock a wide range of lenses from major manufacturers. Regular supply plans are available for daily and monthly wearers, and Duncan & Todd optometrists can fit specialist lenses including toric lenses for astigmatism and multifocal lenses for presbyopia."}}]}5:[["$","$L10",null,{}],["$","main",null,{"className":"flex-1","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Duncan & Todd Group\",\"url\":\"https://www.duncanandtodd.com\",\"description\":\"Duncan & Todd is a leading Scottish opticians group headquartered in Aberdeen, with practices across Scotland and the north of England. Originally established as a single practice, they have grown into one of Scotland's most respected optical groups through a combination of organic growth and acquisitions. They are known for their clinical expertise, wide range of premium eyewear, and strong ties to the communities they serve.\",\"foundingDate\":\"1972\",\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"numberOfEmployees\":{\"@type\":\"QuantitativeValue\",\"name\":\"UK stores\",\"value\":30},\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.duncanandtodd.com\"],\"parentOrganization\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"eyetest.co.uk\",\"url\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk\"}}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Opticians\",\"item\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk/opticians\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Duncan & Todd Group\",\"item\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk/opticians/duncan-and-todd\"}]}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$11"}}],"$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15",false,"$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d"]}],"$L1e"]
