13:["$","section",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 sm:py-20","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"lg:col-span-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--color-navy)] mb-6","children":["About ","Duncan & Todd Group"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-base","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"Duncan & Todd is a leading Scottish opticians group headquartered in Aberdeen, with practices across Scotland and the north of England. Originally established as a single practice, they have grown into one of Scotland's most respected optical groups through a combination of organic growth and acquisitions. They are known for their clinical expertise, wide range of premium eyewear, and strong ties to the communities they serve."}],[["$","p","0",{"children":"Duncan & Todd was founded in 1972 by Ian Todd, who opened his first optical practice in Aberdeen. The business was built on a foundation of clinical excellence and personal service, quickly establishing a reputation as one of the north-east of Scotland's most trusted opticians. Aberdeen's thriving economy, driven by the North Sea oil industry, provided a strong base of patients who valued quality eyewear and thorough eye care, and the practice flourished."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"Throughout the 1980s, 1990s, and 2000s, Duncan & Todd expanded across Scotland, opening new practices in Edinburgh, Glasgow, Dundee, Inverness, Stirling, and Perth. The group also grew through the acquisition of well-established local practices, a strategy that allowed it to enter new communities with an existing patient base and experienced staff. A key advantage for Duncan & Todd in Scotland is the Scottish NHS system, which provides free eye tests to all Scottish residents regardless of age or income — a policy that has been in place since 2006 and has increased the frequency of eye testing across the country."}],["$","p","2",{"children":"More recently, Duncan & Todd has extended its reach south of the border into the north of England, acquiring practices in Newcastle, Sunderland, Durham, and other northern English towns. This expansion has made Duncan & Todd a truly cross-border optical group, and the company now operates around 30 practices. The group has invested in modern clinical technology across its network, including OCT scanning and digital retinal photography, while maintaining the personal, community-focused approach that defined its founding practice in Aberdeen over five decades ago. Duncan & Todd also operates several audiology clinics, offering hearing tests and hearing aids alongside its optical services."}]]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200 h-fit","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)] mb-4","children":"Quick Facts"}],["$","dl",null,{"className":"space-y-3 text-sm","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex justify-between","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-gray-500","children":"Founded"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"font-medium text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"1972"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex justify-between","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-gray-500","children":"UK Stores"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"font-medium text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"30"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex justify-between","children":["$L20","$L21"]}],"$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26"]}]]}]]}]}]
