s."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-4 text-sm","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"From £25"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-gray-400","children":"|"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-gray-500","children":"25-30 minutes"}]]}]]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-5","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start justify-between mb-3","children":[["$","h4",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"Enhanced Eye Examination with OCT"}],false]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3","children":"An advanced eye test that includes OCT (Optical Coherence Tomography) scanning, producing detailed 3D images of the retina and optic nerve. This technology enables early detection of conditions such as glaucoma, macular degeneration, and diabetic retinopathy — often years before symptoms appear. Duncan & Todd recommends this as a baseline scan for patients over 25."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-4 text-sm","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"From £35"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-gray-400","children":"|"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-gray-500","children":"30-35 minutes"}]]}]]}],["$","div","3",{"className":"bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-5","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start justify-between mb-3","children":[["$","h4",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"Contact Lens Fitting"}],false]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3","children":"A specialist appointment for patients wanting to try or change contact lenses. The consultation includes corneal curvature measurements, tear film evaluation, and a trial fitting with the most suitable lens type. Duncan & Todd offers a wide range of contact lens