35:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed","children":"Yes, Duncan & Todd is an independent optical group. It is not part of a multinational corporation like Boots (EssilorLuxottica) or Specsavers. The company was founded in Aberdeen in 1972 and has grown through a combination of organic expansion and acquisition of local practices. Its independent status allows it to choose its own range of frames, invest in the technology it considers most important, and maintain a distinctive approach to patient care."}]
